 "id": "342309257413087", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75334061_342309264079753_2615715454138737248_n.png?_nc_cat=103&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=OIgVZPgBjjYQ7kNvwF3Cp4X&_nc_oc=AdrMCNsc35RjD1QyR7Qo87AzJiLmpqZortG9V9hhlvvH7sdPhtZDzfWjKighu3Htel4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTMLs4cOasQgF4N76qyfcYDmxntrzv5sM74j9PO8QJZGg&oe=6B0054DA"}, "display_name": "Fake Racing", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Fake Racing is an indie racing game with an unusual visual style. \n\nFeatures:\n\n- The monochrome pixelized renderer was created specifically for this game. It uses a custom 3D-dithering shading technique to achieve a retro visual style with one of the three available monochrome palettes. \n- Fake car physics. Non-realistic but fun for casual play.\n- Attack from the Air: compete not only against your opponents, but also against the enemy helicopter. This mode creates an extra challenge for the race leaders, making the race more intense. \n- Four tracks with reverse and mirror options. \n\n\nGame modes:\n\n- Attack from the air;\n- Elimination;\n- Classic race. \n", "short_description": "A retro-style indie racing game with a monochrome pixel graphics and a fake car physics. Features Air Attack and Elimination modes. "}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.romanshuvalov.com/fakeracing/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Roman Shuvalov", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.romanshuvalov.com/", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "673385183287495"}, {"id": "1592192974313489"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["RACING", "ACTION"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "